  "long_description": "Reebee is the best way to browse and distribute flyers. \n\nThe reebee mobile application makes it easy for customers to browse and discover local flyers, stay organized with an integrated shopping list, search products and much more. \n\nAvailable for free in Canada on the Apple App Store, Google Play, and BlackBerry World. \n\nReebee specializes in targeted flyer distribution, engaging the consumer audience through a rich mobile experience.\n\nDigital distribution not only fills in the voids of physical distribution, but it also reaches a new audience with distinctly measurable results. Track consumer buying signals like never before.",
